// groups some of these ship with stripped out (they're always empty), and
// any internal gradient/pattern `id` renamed to a per-icon-unique one
// (several of the source files reused generic ids like "a", which collide
// once more than one of them is inlined onto the same page via v-html,
// since ids must be unique per document). Supabase isn't in that asset
// folder, its mark comes from the simple-icons project instead (CC0).
